                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>本课程为面向口腔医学专业五年制学生的专业必修课，其内容涵盖如下4个模块：</p>
<p><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="" width="1192" height="770"></p>
<p>具体章节详见教学内容安排。</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
