</table>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>第十四章 全身性疾病在儿童口腔的表现</strong></p>
<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;本章主要介绍儿童时期某些血液病、传染性疾病、内分泌疾病等全身性疾病在口腔中的表现，及早发现，准确诊断和及时治疗。介绍了血友病和白血病的临床表现和治疗措施；介绍了艾滋病的临床表现、防控措施及对症处理措施；介绍了糖尿病的口腔表现和处理原则。介绍了常见遗传性疾病的口腔表征和对症治疗计划。</p>
<table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ccc;  border: 1px solid #000000;" border="1">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="37.3600%">
<p>知识点单元</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="62.6400%">
<p>知识点单元目标</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" rowspan="2" width="37.3600%">
<p>血友病、白血病相关的口腔疾病的表现和治疗</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="62.6400%">
<p>描述血友病的临床表现和口腔治疗。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="62.6400%">
<p>描述白血病的口腔表现和治疗。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="37.3600%">
<p>艾滋病等传染性疾病的口腔表现和治疗</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="62.6400%">
<p>正确认识艾滋病，记忆必要的防控措施及处理临床症状的措施。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="37.3600%">
<p>糖尿病等内分泌疾病的口腔表征和治疗</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="62.6400%">
<p>描述糖尿病的口腔表现和相关疾病的治疗。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="37.3600%">
<p>遗传性疾病的口腔表现和治疗</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="62.6400%">
<p>描述遗传性外胚叶发育不全综合征、锁骨颅骨发育不全综合征、低磷酸酯酶症唐氏综合征、掌跖角化-牙周破坏综合征、朗格汉斯细胞组织细胞增生症的临床症状和治疗。</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
